                        	 10699: ;## ntc_ldiv
                        	 10700: ; z_l0 / z_l1 signed, truncating (JSR): z_l0 = quotient, z_l1 = remainder (the
                        	 10701: ; dividend's sign). Divide by 0: quotient 0, remainder = dividend. Uses z_l2, z_t0, z_t1
                        	 10702: ntc_ldiv:
